│   ├── Gain_after.sh <!--Get the root file, pdf file and txt file after calibration-->
│   ├── Gain_before.sh <!--Get the root file, pdf file and txt file before calibration, this is only to care about maximum gain channel-->
│   ├── HV_cal2.sh <!--Get the Gain vs. HV and get the HV @abs.gain is 10^6-->
│   ├── HV_cal.sh <!--Get the result of maximum gain channel for HV calibration -->
│   ├── Mask_updated.sh <!--Run script and update gain factor for better gain factor to nearby 10^6 -->
│   ├── OpenMP_after_correction.sh <!--accelarate calculation -->
│   └── tets.sh <!--test script for some special test-->
